WEBVTT

00:20.410 --> 00:22.580
I see...

00:22.580 --> 00:24.080
So I'm a dumbass now?

00:24.080 --> 00:27.040
Yeah, I was talking to <i>you,</i> dumbass.

00:28.290 --> 00:30.000
Remember that!

00:30.460 --> 00:31.960
Now die!

00:31.990 --> 00:32.070
BANG!

00:37.170 --> 00:38.840
Who the fuck is <i>this dude?</i>

00:40.010 --> 00:43.060
Dammit! Man up and tell me what it's gonna be!

00:43.060 --> 00:45.270
Am I still a dumbass, eh, schoolboy?

00:45.270 --> 00:46.350
Uh, no you're not!

00:46.350 --> 00:48.810
Wait! D-Don't do it!

00:59.530 --> 01:01.490
Pervs are icky!

01:01.490 --> 01:05.080
I'm Imai! Imai Katsutoshi!

01:09.870 --> 01:11.960
You got some balls, kid.

01:11.960 --> 01:12.910
Shaddap!

01:16.340 --> 01:19.250
This is for what you did to those kids, bastard!

01:26.100 --> 01:28.100
So we got one more, eh?

01:28.100 --> 01:29.310
Hell yeah!

01:29.310 --> 01:32.100
Mitsuhashi Special Kick!

01:41.230 --> 01:44.950
That was brilliant, magnificent! I couldn't have asked for more.

01:44.950 --> 01:49.950
You got me so fucking hot, I <i>really wanted to get in on the action.</i>

01:49.950 --> 01:54.960
Ooh, I’m loving that look you got on! You got my adrenaline boiling!

01:56.090 --> 01:59.420
He really is a pervert! Perverts are icky!

02:00.000 --> 02:01.090
Wait up, Mitsuhashi!

02:01.090 --> 02:02.380
Y-You bastards!

02:02.960 --> 02:04.010
Get back here!

02:04.010 --> 02:05.130
Hey!

02:05.130 --> 02:06.510
Help me carry him!

02:06.510 --> 02:07.840
Perverts are icky!

02:10.100 --> 02:11.350
This is perfect.

02:11.350 --> 02:13.340
I love this town.

02:13.340 --> 02:17.110
I'll love it even more once I get those two lying at my feet.

02:18.430 --> 02:28.350
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

02:18.430 --> 02:28.350
Starting  today,  I'll!!

02:21.890 --> 02:28.350
On the Run from the Yakuza

02:29.790 --> 02:31.580
Yo, heard the word?

02:31.580 --> 02:35.040
Itou put a serious beating on some yakuza thugs!

02:35.040 --> 02:37.340
Mitsuhashi was there too,

02:37.340 --> 02:38.750
fighting dirty as usual.

02:38.750 --> 02:41.130
But you think they messed with the wrong people?

02:41.130 --> 02:44.010
The yakuza ain't gonna let that stand.

02:46.510 --> 02:48.680
Oh, there they are!

02:51.230 --> 02:52.060
Mitsuhashi, stop it!

02:52.060 --> 02:53.560
Shut up! Move it!

02:53.560 --> 02:56.480
What are you guys doing?

02:56.480 --> 02:57.900
Oh, it's just Sagawa.

02:57.900 --> 02:59.940
Don't scare us like that, dumbass!

02:59.940 --> 03:02.490
I just heard the news, Mitsuhashi!

03:02.490 --> 03:04.780
Did you really beat some yakuzas to a pulp?

03:07.070 --> 03:09.240
Looks like everybody knows.

03:09.240 --> 03:13.710
Man, you two are frickin' unbelievable!

03:13.710 --> 03:16.710
But I knew you guys would
someday make a big splash.

03:16.710 --> 03:18.090
H-Hold on!

03:18.090 --> 03:20.500
We didn't do nothing! It was Beni High's Imai!

03:20.500 --> 03:22.260
We had jack shit to do with it!

03:22.260 --> 03:24.880
But you later threw yourself in the mix.

03:24.880 --> 03:26.920
Dammit, we gotta stick to that alibi!

03:26.920 --> 03:29.760
What's going on, Mitsuhashi?

03:30.100 --> 03:33.930
Look, Imai's the one who did everything, and don't you forget it!

03:33.930 --> 03:36.100
We didn't do shit, got it?

03:36.100 --> 03:37.400
Uh, right.

03:37.400 --> 03:40.570
Fire up those phones and
spread the word, you hear?

03:40.570 --> 03:41.270
Got it.

03:42.150 --> 03:44.150
Imai's a fucking pain in the ass!

03:47.620 --> 03:49.330
Look, it's him!

03:49.330 --> 03:51.080
He beat up some underworld thugs!

03:51.080 --> 03:52.040
You mean him?

03:52.040 --> 03:53.500
Beni High's Imai!

03:53.500 --> 03:54.710
He's awesome!

03:54.710 --> 03:57.000
Wow, he looks like Kimura Takuya!

03:57.000 --> 03:58.160
Look at his long legs!

03:58.630 --> 04:01.210
I heard he tore down their offices too!

04:01.210 --> 04:02.460
Are you serious?

04:02.460 --> 04:04.550
Imai!

04:04.550 --> 04:05.250
Hey!

04:06.590 --> 04:08.050
You're the man!

04:08.050 --> 04:10.970
Everyone in town is talking about you!

04:12.430 --> 04:13.430
Is that right?

04:13.430 --> 04:14.430
You don't mean that.

04:14.430 --> 04:18.060
No, it's like you're the hero around here!

04:18.060 --> 04:19.150
It's true!

04:19.150 --> 04:22.110
You're practically glowing, Imai!

04:22.110 --> 04:25.070
Enough of that. Flattery won't get you anywhere.

04:26.900 --> 04:30.450
I know I put you guys through a lot in the past.

04:30.450 --> 04:32.030
But today's different.

04:32.030 --> 04:33.990
Today I'm a changed man.

04:33.990 --> 04:37.120
I feel the strength of a hero coursing through my body.

04:37.120 --> 04:39.830
Wow, that's awesome, boss!

04:39.830 --> 04:40.580
Imai!

04:41.210 --> 04:45.630
I'm telling you, if Riko sees you now, she'll instantly fall for you.

04:45.630 --> 04:46.970
Y-You think so?

04:47.970 --> 04:49.220
Riko!

04:50.430 --> 04:53.100
Why does she look so sad?

04:53.100 --> 04:55.020
Imai, this is your chance!

04:55.020 --> 04:55.600
What?

04:55.600 --> 05:01.650
This is where a magnanimous man swoops in to comfort a crestfallen maiden.

05:01.650 --> 05:04.480
If you brighten up her day with your presence,

05:04.480 --> 05:06.440
she'll be yours for the taking!

05:07.320 --> 05:08.490
She'll be mine?

05:12.780 --> 05:16.040
Imai, you've really changed.

05:16.040 --> 05:17.700
You're really manly now.

05:18.250 --> 05:21.160
You're the one who changed me, Riko.

05:27.760 --> 05:28.960
That's perfect!

05:29.500 --> 05:31.680
In that case, we have to hurry.

05:31.680 --> 05:32.970
I'll show her the new me!

05:32.970 --> 05:34.510
We're off, Tanigawa and Koyama!

05:34.510 --> 05:36.180
Yes! Lead the way!

05:40.480 --> 05:41.520
What to do?

05:41.520 --> 05:42.890
Riko.

05:43.270 --> 05:44.520
Imai!

05:44.520 --> 05:45.690
What's wrong?

05:45.690 --> 05:47.610
It looks like you're sighing in frustration.

05:47.610 --> 05:49.240
That's not right.

05:49.240 --> 05:51.780
A beautiful woman shouldn't be sighing.

05:52.240 --> 05:54.410
What happened, Imai?

05:54.410 --> 05:55.700
There's something different about you.

05:55.700 --> 05:59.080
Look! It's working! It's working, Imai!

05:59.080 --> 06:03.500
Aw, shucks! I didn't think I had changed <i>that much!</i>

06:03.500 --> 06:06.170
But I guess you noticed anyways.

06:06.960 --> 06:08.550
You should take care of yourself,

06:08.550 --> 06:10.800
especially when the seasons change.

06:13.140 --> 06:15.010
So is there something the matter?

06:16.060 --> 06:16.840
Yeah...

06:19.180 --> 06:20.440
Those are kittens!

06:23.060 --> 06:24.690
What are they doing in there?

06:24.690 --> 06:27.100
They were abandoned, the poor things.

06:27.690 --> 06:32.700
But I can't take them home because my dad hates cats.

06:32.700 --> 06:34.570
Don't be so modest, Riko.

06:35.820 --> 06:40.700
I, Imai Katsutoshi, will be honored to shoulder all your burdens.

06:40.700 --> 06:43.330
I can't stand seeing you pained in your delicate bosom.

06:43.330 --> 06:46.710
Of course, I'm not talking about its size.

06:48.300 --> 06:52.880
Are you willing to give me custody of those poor, helpless kittens?

06:52.880 --> 06:53.760
Really?

06:53.760 --> 06:54.970
Of course!

06:54.470 --> 06:56.720
You're a lifesaver!

06:54.970 --> 06:56.720
I love cats.

06:56.720 --> 07:00.350
In return, would you care to join me for tea...

06:56.720 --> 07:00.350
I needed to get home and cook dinner.

07:00.350 --> 07:02.470
Thanks for taking care of these kitties!

07:03.140 --> 07:04.440
Bye!

07:11.610 --> 07:12.400
Yow!

07:12.740 --> 07:16.120
Imai, do we really have to look after them?

07:16.120 --> 07:18.160
I don't even like cats!

07:18.160 --> 07:19.860
I'm not good with cats either!

07:19.860 --> 07:24.040
Now wait, that's not what you told Riko!

07:24.040 --> 07:27.040
There are both public faces and private ones.

07:28.750 --> 07:30.290
What the hell is this?!

07:30.710 --> 07:32.750
You coulda hit us! Watch where you're—

07:33.300 --> 07:34.510
This is a surprise!

07:34.510 --> 07:38.470
I'da thought you skipped town after pulling that shit.

07:39.600 --> 07:41.640
We thought it'd take days to find you,

07:41.640 --> 07:44.140
but here you are on a Sunday stroll.

07:44.140 --> 07:45.220
Are you guys half-retarded?

07:46.270 --> 07:47.520
God, them again!

07:47.520 --> 07:48.430
Imai...

07:48.430 --> 07:49.770
Hey, what's the deal?

07:49.770 --> 07:51.400
Don't you got nothing to say?

07:51.860 --> 07:57.530
We'll teach you punk kids what happens when you mess with the yakuza.

07:57.530 --> 07:58.860
Now let's go to our establishment.

08:01.990 --> 08:02.530
Tanigawa.

08:03.370 --> 08:03.990
Yeah?

08:04.460 --> 08:06.870
Once I give the word, you two start running.

08:06.870 --> 08:08.330
Don't you dare let 'em catch you!

08:08.790 --> 08:10.290
But what about you, Imai?

08:10.840 --> 08:15.470
You two need to take care of Riko's kittens!

08:15.470 --> 08:16.130
Got it?!

08:16.130 --> 08:17.800
Y-Yeah.

08:17.800 --> 08:20.010
Imai... you really are the man!

08:20.010 --> 08:22.770
Hey! What're you chatting about?!

08:22.770 --> 08:25.510
We'll fillet your ass if you try anything funny!

08:26.850 --> 08:27.970
Fine!

08:32.400 --> 08:36.110
You sure you wanna pull any pranks knowing we got one of your friends?

08:36.110 --> 08:38.320
What? My friend?

08:39.320 --> 08:41.030
Your little lady friend.

08:41.030 --> 08:42.490
Are you talking about Riko?

08:42.490 --> 08:45.040
Yeah, that Riko babe.

08:45.040 --> 08:47.500
We took her for a ride knowing you're acquainted with her.

08:47.500 --> 08:50.080
Damn, she was a cutie pie, wasn't she?

08:50.080 --> 08:51.960
Huh? Oh, right.

08:53.420 --> 08:54.420
You got Riko?

08:54.420 --> 08:58.050
You gonna tell us where that blond boy and his hedgehog are at?

08:58.050 --> 09:00.380
Or do we have to take care of your precious little Riko?

09:00.380 --> 09:02.680
Goddammit, that's low!

09:02.680 --> 09:04.470
Enough of your smartassery!

09:04.470 --> 09:06.510
We ain't fucking playing here!

09:07.640 --> 09:08.680
Imai!

09:08.680 --> 09:11.060
Guys! Load ‘em in the car!

09:11.060 --> 09:11.640
On it!

09:19.450 --> 09:21.740
You there, may I have your attention please?

09:21.160 --> 09:22.490
Hey, let's beat it!

09:21.740 --> 09:23.410
Desist in your violent activities!

09:23.410 --> 09:24.790
They will not be tolerated!

09:29.250 --> 09:30.920
Violence isn't the answer!

09:30.920 --> 09:33.210
People, please refrain from violence!

09:33.210 --> 09:34.840
Wait, it's just Mitsuhashi!

09:34.840 --> 09:36.050
What are you doing?

09:36.050 --> 09:37.550
What am <i>I doing?</i>

09:37.550 --> 09:39.090
Saving your dumb asses, of course!

09:39.090 --> 09:40.380
You're welcome!

09:40.680 --> 09:43.970
Not that I care, but can you take that thing off?

09:43.970 --> 09:46.010
You stand out just as much as Imai.

09:46.010 --> 09:49.180
Itou, please don't lump me together with Imai!

09:49.180 --> 09:52.020
This isn't the time for your usual banter!

09:52.020 --> 09:54.560
Riko's been kidnapped by those guys!

09:55.320 --> 09:56.270
What did you say?

09:58.190 --> 10:00.860
God, that idiot! Why wasn't she watching herself!

10:00.860 --> 10:03.400
Even Riko can't escape the yakuza!

10:03.910 --> 10:06.370
Why do <i>I gotta save her anyway?</i>

10:06.370 --> 10:08.500
This is no fucking time to complain!

10:08.500 --> 10:09.620
Shut your trap!

10:13.080 --> 10:14.880
Man, am I lucky.

10:14.880 --> 10:18.290
I can't believe I get to run into all three of you <i>this soon!</i>

10:20.010 --> 10:22.710
Come on, I'll take all three of you on!

10:28.970 --> 10:29.970
Bastards!

10:29.970 --> 10:32.190
Have I met that guy before?

10:32.190 --> 10:33.930
It's that "pervert" from the other day!

10:34.640 --> 10:35.770
Perverts are icky!

10:35.770 --> 10:37.400
You running from me?!

10:37.400 --> 10:39.400
Shit. What's with them?

10:39.400 --> 10:41.610
Imai!

10:42.360 --> 10:43.490
Wait for us!

10:43.490 --> 10:45.070
Hey, stay still!

10:46.990 --> 10:49.540
Hey, you know those guys?

10:49.540 --> 10:51.000
Wh-Who the hell are you?

10:51.000 --> 10:52.960
Who the fuck are they after?

10:52.960 --> 10:54.410
Talk, dammit!

10:55.500 --> 10:56.620
Well...

10:57.250 --> 10:58.080
What?

10:58.080 --> 11:00.420
Their woman got jacked by the yakuza?

11:01.510 --> 11:04.800
Why would they lose their shit over a piece of ass? Idiots.

11:04.800 --> 11:09.100
Idiots? Someone's life is on the line here!

11:10.020 --> 11:11.350
By the way...

11:11.350 --> 11:12.850
What?

11:12.850 --> 11:14.060
Would you like a cat?

11:15.920 --> 11:18.380
The Underworld Family

11:22.070 --> 11:25.470
S-So that's a real yakuza office?

11:25.470 --> 11:27.070
I-It's real, all right.

11:27.070 --> 11:29.530
It looks pretty damn intimidating.

11:29.530 --> 11:31.500
S... So how do we sneak in?

11:31.500 --> 11:33.870
Don't ask me.

11:33.870 --> 11:36.000
This isn't the time to quibble!

11:36.420 --> 11:40.210
A man would bash his way through the front and rescue Riko!

11:40.210 --> 11:41.460
That's the only way!

11:41.460 --> 11:43.710
Dude, now that's <i>cool!</i>

11:43.490 --> 11:45.490
""Imai has really changed,"

11:45.490 --> 11:47.120
thought Itou.

11:47.720 --> 11:49.720
What is this idiot talking about?

11:49.500 --> 11:52.000
"This dude must've got something twisted,"

11:52.000 --> 11:53.710
thought Mitsuhashi.

11:54.390 --> 11:55.640
What's with you?

11:55.640 --> 11:57.520
Are you scared or something?

11:57.520 --> 11:59.440
Wh-What're you saying?

11:59.440 --> 12:02.110
I'll lay you out first if you keep talking that bullshit!

12:03.190 --> 12:04.530
That's good.

12:04.530 --> 12:06.990
That's what I need to see in my bitter rivals.

12:06.990 --> 12:08.030
All right, let's move!

12:08.030 --> 12:09.030
Yeah!

12:14.000 --> 12:16.790
We'll see what he does before we act.

12:16.790 --> 12:17.700
Yeah.

12:20.070 --> 12:22.530
A Publicly-Traded Corporation

12:20.070 --> 12:20.820
The Underworld Family

12:26.130 --> 12:27.380
Riko!

12:27.380 --> 12:29.970
Your man, Imai Katsutoshi, is here to save you!

12:30.510 --> 12:31.340
Here I come!

12:31.120 --> 12:32.870
Itou thought,

12:33.090 --> 12:34.350
Damn!

12:34.130 --> 12:35.880
Mitsuhashi thought,

12:35.900 --> 12:37.810
Yeah, he got something twisted.

12:48.940 --> 12:50.820
It's <i>too quiet.</i>

12:50.820 --> 12:53.540
Imai's a poor bastard now that I think about it.

12:53.540 --> 12:56.070
What? They killed him?

12:56.070 --> 12:59.830
Listen, Itou, talk shit to the yakuza and get them to fight you.

12:59.830 --> 13:03.050
I'll extract Imai's corpse and Riko while they're distracted.

13:03.050 --> 13:05.050
I-I don't wanna do that!

13:05.450 --> 13:06.910
The Underworld Family

13:07.660 --> 13:07.700
A Publicly-Traded Corporation

13:07.720 --> 13:08.680
That's Imai!

13:08.680 --> 13:10.010
He's alive?

13:10.970 --> 13:12.300
He's calling us.

13:12.300 --> 13:13.560
What should we do, Mitsuhashi?

13:13.560 --> 13:14.680
Yeah...

13:14.680 --> 13:16.560
It's a setup.

13:16.560 --> 13:19.020
They got guns pointed at his back.

13:19.380 --> 13:20.510
The Underworld Family

13:19.380 --> 13:20.510
A Publicly-Traded Corporation

13:24.190 --> 13:25.690
Wh-What should we do?

13:25.690 --> 13:29.340
Isn't it obvious? We go and...

13:29.340 --> 13:31.660
Run!

13:33.150 --> 13:33.700
Mitsuhashi!

13:33.700 --> 13:34.830
Hey!

13:34.830 --> 13:36.250
What the hell are you doing?!

13:38.290 --> 13:40.000
Aren't you gonna come?

13:40.000 --> 13:41.920
They got nobody in there, for chrissake!

13:41.920 --> 13:42.840
Really?

13:43.500 --> 13:48.130
W-Well, we need to make sure there's an escape route in case of an emergency.

13:48.130 --> 13:48.790
Yeah.

13:49.470 --> 13:52.510
Is <i>this who I've been fighting?</i>

13:52.510 --> 13:54.100
What are you standing around for?

13:54.100 --> 13:55.310
We're going in.

13:55.310 --> 13:57.260
Should I get new rivals?

14:02.960 --> 14:03.010
Humanity

14:02.960 --> 14:03.010
Love

14:02.960 --> 14:03.010
Honor

14:07.100 --> 14:09.610
See, what did I tell you?

14:09.610 --> 14:14.160
There's a fireworks display tonight, so they're probably out on business.

14:14.160 --> 14:16.370
What's got you shaking in your boots?

14:16.370 --> 14:17.870
Come on!

14:17.870 --> 14:19.960
They got Riko under lock and key,

14:19.960 --> 14:21.920
so she has to be around here.

14:21.920 --> 14:23.370
Watch your step.

14:23.710 --> 14:27.710
I'll search downstairs, you guys got the 2nd and 3rd floors. Got it?

14:27.710 --> 14:31.220
Who the fuck died and made you king?! Don't make me—

14:32.130 --> 14:34.180
What should we do with that, huh?

14:34.700 --> 14:46.630
Chinese

14:34.700 --> 14:46.630
Daikokuya

14:36.560 --> 14:39.390
We're busy now, call back later.

14:40.140 --> 14:41.520
Happy hunting, guys!

14:41.520 --> 14:42.520
Damn!

14:42.520 --> 14:45.150
H-He <i>must've got something twisted.</i>

14:45.150 --> 14:46.850
Screw it, let's go.

14:59.080 --> 15:00.200
Hey!

15:02.030 --> 15:03.740
What the hell's with you guys?

15:04.420 --> 15:06.500
Oh, it's just Imai. Don't scare us like that!

15:06.500 --> 15:08.460
And you call yourselves men?

15:08.460 --> 15:10.840
But we just saw a tiger in there.

15:10.840 --> 15:11.840
A tiger?

15:11.840 --> 15:12.720
Yeah.

15:29.230 --> 15:31.150
Do you see that? A tiger!

15:31.150 --> 15:34.530
Mitsuhashi, Itou, have you heard of this saying?

15:34.530 --> 15:37.120
"If you think it's a ghost, you're looking at fronds."

15:37.120 --> 15:38.160
No.

15:38.160 --> 15:42.250
Long ago, there was a guy named Joe Fronds that had long hair.

15:42.250 --> 15:46.790
So he's used as an example of something that only <i>looks like a scary apparition.</i>

15:46.570 --> 15:49.900
"Fronds" are actually leaves.

15:46.790 --> 15:50.120
Wow, you're actually pretty smart!

15:51.760 --> 15:55.590
This big room must have a hidden door somewhere.

15:56.550 --> 15:58.130
Talk about horrible tastes!

16:10.360 --> 16:11.260
Itou...

16:11.260 --> 16:12.230
What?

16:12.230 --> 16:14.240
W-We're leaving this dangerous place.

16:14.240 --> 16:16.570
W-Wait, Mitsuhashi.

16:16.570 --> 16:18.690
Hey, wait for me, douches!

16:18.980 --> 16:21.910
Imai, are you sure Riko's been kidnapped?

16:21.910 --> 16:24.160
I'm sure. They told me themselves.

16:24.160 --> 16:26.750
They said they got my lady friend.

16:26.750 --> 16:28.940
Why would you think it's Riko?!

16:29.500 --> 16:30.710
Don't give us that!

16:30.710 --> 16:32.920
Did the yakuza actually say "Riko"?

16:32.920 --> 16:33.760
They did!

16:33.760 --> 16:37.590
They told me it was her after I asked them if they took Riko!

16:39.260 --> 16:41.720
Imai! They played you, you dumb fuck!

16:43.640 --> 16:45.770
It's nothing to get mad about!

16:45.770 --> 16:49.480
You should be glad that Riko wasn't actually kidnapped.

16:49.480 --> 16:51.190
That's not the fucking point here!

17:01.020 --> 17:01.060
The Underworld Family

17:01.060 --> 17:01.100
A Publicly Traded Corporation

17:01.780 --> 17:03.570
You assholes! Open up!

17:06.870 --> 17:08.420
You little punks!

17:08.420 --> 17:09.500
Don't let them get away!

17:13.000 --> 17:14.550
Hey! Get back here!

17:15.210 --> 17:16.920
Hey! Over here!

17:16.920 --> 17:18.130
Hold up!

17:18.130 --> 17:18.880
Let's go!

17:19.380 --> 17:20.340
Open up, goddammit!

17:20.340 --> 17:22.760
Open the fucking door!

17:27.300 --> 17:30.690
For Christ's sake! Will you grow a fucking pair already!

17:30.690 --> 17:32.900
How much of a fucking retard are you?!

17:32.900 --> 17:34.730
Those guys aren't your average hoods!

17:34.730 --> 17:35.980
So what about it?

17:35.980 --> 17:38.770
We can still take on their numbers!

17:39.110 --> 17:42.530
Just 'cause they're the yakuza doesn't mean you should run scared!

17:42.530 --> 17:44.620
Imai, think about it.

17:44.620 --> 17:47.620
Those guys come with a bunch of knives and gats!

17:47.620 --> 17:50.240
Yeah, dumbass, what's the point if they kill you?

17:50.540 --> 17:51.750
Why worry?

17:51.750 --> 17:54.000
We're all gonna die someday, right?

17:54.000 --> 17:57.340
I, for one, will gladly die for Misako or Riko.

17:57.340 --> 17:58.920
My only regret is parting with them.

17:58.920 --> 18:01.960
Dumbass! What do Misako and Riko gotta do with this?!

18:01.960 --> 18:04.390
God, you make it sound so easy,

18:04.390 --> 18:06.970
but do you know what happens when you die?

18:06.970 --> 18:09.390
It means saying goodbye to this world.

18:09.390 --> 18:11.480
It won't be a quick death.

18:11.480 --> 18:13.360
Imagine them stabbing and shooting you.

18:13.360 --> 18:15.730
You'll be lying down writhing in agony.

18:15.730 --> 18:16.360
You're kidding!

18:16.360 --> 18:17.690
No we're not!

18:17.690 --> 18:19.690
It'll hurt worse than a real nasty cavity!

18:19.690 --> 18:20.320
You're kidding!

18:20.320 --> 18:23.530
They'll chop up your body to dispose of the evidence.

18:23.530 --> 18:25.530
Maybe even use food processors.

18:25.530 --> 18:28.030
Then they'll feed you to the pigs.

18:28.030 --> 18:28.910
You're kidding.

18:28.910 --> 18:30.910
Hey, open up, you fuckers!

18:30.910 --> 18:33.000
We'll turn youse into pig food!

18:33.000 --> 18:35.590
So there you have it, Imai.

18:35.590 --> 18:37.420
That's why we're leaving.

18:37.420 --> 18:38.380
Wait, Mitsuhashi!

18:38.380 --> 18:40.090
We hope you find peace in heaven.

18:40.090 --> 18:41.420
Hey, Mitsuhashi! Itou!

18:41.420 --> 18:42.510
No, wait!

18:42.510 --> 18:43.460
Shithead!

18:43.460 --> 18:44.840
The hell are you doing?

18:44.840 --> 18:46.600
Hey! Bring the gun!

18:46.600 --> 18:48.680
We'll blast the fucking door open!

18:48.680 --> 18:51.140
Later, Imai.

18:51.140 --> 18:53.850
"Later"? Guys...

18:53.850 --> 18:57.600
I see. If I die, I won't be able to do anything.

18:57.600 --> 19:00.650
Say, do you remember this moron named Imai?

19:00.650 --> 19:01.650
What, who?

19:01.650 --> 19:04.360
Wasn't he the boss of Beni High?

19:04.360 --> 19:05.590
Seriously, who?

19:05.590 --> 19:08.160
Forget about him, let's have some fun!

19:08.160 --> 19:10.120
I'm in!

19:11.400 --> 19:11.520
So who's Imai again?

19:15.790 --> 19:17.710
No! No! I don't wanna die!

19:17.710 --> 19:19.630
You sure about this, Mitsuhashi?

19:19.630 --> 19:21.670
Sure as hell! Leave him to the wolves!

19:21.670 --> 19:23.880
I don't wanna die! Help me!

19:23.880 --> 19:25.430
I... I...

19:25.430 --> 19:28.760
I never even kissed a girl!

19:28.760 --> 19:32.140
That poor lug. We should be ashamed of ourselves.

19:32.140 --> 19:34.930
Let's save him. He has it hard enough as it is.

19:38.730 --> 19:40.690
Get back here, you little shits!

19:40.690 --> 19:41.190
Stop!

19:43.110 --> 19:44.650
Stop right there!

19:51.660 --> 19:53.370
Three?

19:53.370 --> 19:55.670
What are you doing there?

19:55.670 --> 19:57.580
You all right, Riko?

19:57.580 --> 19:58.500
Listen.

19:58.500 --> 20:01.500
Some creeps are out and about, so make sure they don't nab you.

20:01.500 --> 20:02.760
Don't go outside!

20:03.380 --> 20:05.180
Huh? Wait, Three!

20:05.800 --> 20:08.220
He must have caused some trouble again.

20:08.220 --> 20:09.600
Honestly!

20:18.480 --> 20:21.860
Even <i>they wouldn't follow us all the way out here.</i>

20:21.860 --> 20:23.110
Yeah.

20:23.110 --> 20:27.490
This is <i>definitely not the first place they'd think to look.</i>

20:28.110 --> 20:29.490
Hey, you guys!

20:29.490 --> 20:30.400
How?!

20:30.400 --> 20:32.950
You hide about as well as ostriches!

20:32.950 --> 20:35.210
You stand out like sore thumbs!

20:35.710 --> 20:37.580
Oh, it's just Tanigawa.

20:37.580 --> 20:39.250
Don't scare us like that!

20:39.250 --> 20:41.920
We can't find Imai!

20:41.920 --> 20:43.460
Wasn't he with you?

20:43.460 --> 20:45.510
Uh, well, you see...

20:45.510 --> 20:47.420
Riko's safe and sound, but...

20:47.930 --> 20:52.680
W-Wait, you didn't leave Imai behind, did you? Huh?

20:52.680 --> 20:54.390
Come on, say something!

20:54.890 --> 20:57.440
Sorry, Tanigawa, but we had no choice.

20:57.440 --> 20:59.650
That dope wanted to play hero.

20:59.650 --> 21:00.850
You're kidding...

21:00.850 --> 21:03.810
Even so, leaving him behind is simply cruel!

21:03.810 --> 21:06.070
But you know who we're up against.

21:06.070 --> 21:10.070
Besides, it was Imai's dumbfuckery that got us in this whole mess.

21:10.070 --> 21:12.950
We've had it with that son of a bitch.

21:12.950 --> 21:13.660
Later!

21:13.660 --> 21:14.660
No...

21:14.660 --> 21:18.840
You were the one who put him through all that misery!

21:19.670 --> 21:22.000
If Imai dies, it's on you!

21:22.000 --> 21:23.710
You murderer!

21:24.880 --> 21:26.420
Wh-Why'd you take it that far?

21:26.840 --> 21:29.760
Imai turned out that way all because of you!

21:30.090 --> 21:33.970
You've always, <i>always used him to get ahead for whatever reason!</i>

21:33.970 --> 21:37.310
B-But... Imai's always fucking up shit in some way!

21:37.310 --> 21:39.930
And you always sit back and laugh!

21:40.270 --> 21:43.190
Say that again! Just try fucking repeating that!

21:43.770 --> 21:46.610
Tanigawa, we can't deny what you've said.

21:46.610 --> 21:48.650
We'll go back and get Imai for you.

21:48.650 --> 21:49.650
H-Hey!

21:50.200 --> 21:51.190
Itou!

21:51.190 --> 21:52.640
Come on, let's go, Mitsuhashi.

21:52.640 --> 21:55.030
W-Wait, does that mean I gotta go too?

21:55.030 --> 21:59.330
Mitsuhashi! If you don't go, I'll spread the word you're a fucking murderer!

21:59.330 --> 22:00.370
What didja say, Tanigawa?

22:00.370 --> 22:02.010
This shit ain't over between us!

22:02.010 --> 22:03.710
Don't get it twisted!

22:02.920 --> 22:03.710
Shut up!

22:03.710 --> 22:05.170
Move your fucking ass!

22:05.170 --> 22:08.170
Goddammit! Why'd this have to happen!

22:09.380 --> 22:11.630
Man, this blows.

22:12.010 --> 22:15.720
I must've really sunken low if Tanigawa's sermonizing me.

22:15.720 --> 22:17.560
You were already at rock bottom.

22:19.270 --> 22:20.560
Yo.

22:20.560 --> 22:23.140
You can't keep running from me.

22:23.770 --> 22:24.980
Him again?

22:24.980 --> 22:28.110
We always run into him at exactly the wrong time.

22:28.110 --> 22:30.650
Sorry, but we're busy with stuff!

22:30.650 --> 22:32.990
Our friend's life is in danger!

22:32.990 --> 22:34.490
Fuck your friend.

22:34.490 --> 22:38.660
I made the move all the way out here so I could pound both your asses.

22:38.660 --> 22:42.200
So you guys better make it worth my while!

22:43.000 --> 22:44.460
I admire your efforts, dude.

22:44.460 --> 22:47.750
Are you some loner who's got no friends?

22:47.750 --> 22:51.420
You want us to find you some chicks, eh, boy?

22:51.420 --> 22:54.970
You fucking bottle blond, don't you dare talk shit to me!

22:55.390 --> 22:56.720
Fuggit.

22:56.720 --> 23:00.140
Itou, it looks like we gotta use our secret move.

23:00.140 --> 23:00.930
Okay.

23:01.980 --> 23:05.890
Great. I'll gladly take the both of you on!

23:05.890 --> 23:09.150
The name of Mitsuhashi and Itou's secret move is:

23:09.150 --> 23:12.230
"We Don't Mess with Morons! Goodbye!"

23:12.230 --> 23:12.940
Assholes!

23:12.940 --> 23:14.530
Come back, you dirty rats!

23:14.530 --> 23:17.360
Hah! Girls hate clingy guys!

23:20.450 --> 23:22.210
There's the blond and the spikey-haired guy!

23:22.210 --> 23:23.790
You're not getting away this time!

23:24.460 --> 23:25.540
Shit!

23:25.540 --> 23:26.830
What now, Mitsuhashi?!

23:26.830 --> 23:28.250
In that case...

23:28.250 --> 23:30.540
We're gonna have to take him!

23:30.540 --> 23:32.040
Follow my lead!

23:34.920 --> 23:36.630
Now we're cooking!

23:39.010 --> 23:40.180
Wh-What the?

23:40.180 --> 23:41.770
Sorry, but you're coming with us!

23:41.770 --> 23:43.640
We'll dance with you later!

23:43.640 --> 23:45.900
Hey, leggo! Fight me, dammit!

23:45.900 --> 23:48.390
I said let go!

23:51.090 --> 23:54.050
The Underworld Family

24:00.280 --> 24:01.330
I don't hear a sound.

24:01.330 --> 24:03.830
They must've already killed Imai.

24:03.830 --> 24:07.000
I can feel my adrenaline gushing.

24:07.000 --> 24:09.170
I swear, you're such a weirdo!

24:09.170 --> 24:10.170
You wanna have at me?

24:10.170 --> 24:11.460
Let's go, Mitsuhashi!

24:11.460 --> 24:12.220
Right!

24:17.050 --> 24:19.010
I remember it being that room.

24:19.010 --> 24:21.060
Yeah, he was there.

24:21.850 --> 24:25.970
Remember, we're gonna fight after we rescue your friend.

24:25.970 --> 24:27.850
Don't worry, we promise!

24:27.850 --> 24:31.730
Anyways, Ibaraki, can you navigate yourself up there?

24:31.730 --> 24:33.490
Don't take me for a chump.

24:36.860 --> 24:39.320
Ooh, that's our midget. He's fast!

24:39.320 --> 24:41.830
Why are you bringing Nakano along?

24:41.830 --> 24:44.250
The guy's pretty built.

24:44.250 --> 24:47.420
I'm thinking of using him as a shield if it comes to that.

24:48.620 --> 24:49.530
C'mon, let's go!

24:50.460 --> 24:51.980
What an evil bastard.

24:51.980 --> 24:53.960
Will I be his next victim?

24:56.090 --> 24:57.340
Hey, you see him?

24:57.340 --> 24:59.430
No, it's too dark in there...

25:09.880 --> 25:14.090
Imai is still holding the door.

25:12.360 --> 25:14.310
M... Mitsuhashi!

25:16.570 --> 25:18.240
What do you think you're doing?

25:18.240 --> 25:21.370
What am I doing? Keeping the door shut!

25:21.370 --> 25:23.910
How could you leave me like that?!

25:23.910 --> 25:27.670
If it weren't for me, you guys wouldn't have gotten away!

25:29.330 --> 25:30.330
You can let go.

25:30.330 --> 25:33.250
If I do that, the yakuza will come rushing in!

25:33.250 --> 25:36.670
Let go of the damn doorknob! Or else we'll leave you!

25:41.300 --> 25:42.820
Hurry the fuck up, dumbass!

25:46.890 --> 25:49.900
See? They thought we've
long split, so nobody's...

25:50.940 --> 25:52.230
What's that you're doing?

25:52.230 --> 25:57.610
I... I... I can't move. My body's all stiff.

25:57.610 --> 25:59.900
This guy's unbelievable!

25:59.900 --> 26:02.200
So, should we carry him?

26:05.370 --> 26:06.820
What the fuck are you doing?!

26:09.870 --> 26:11.920
We've done what we came to do.

26:11.920 --> 26:13.790
Now we're gonna fight like you promised!

26:14.130 --> 26:16.550
Why in fuck's name would you wanna do it here?

26:16.550 --> 26:19.500
This is a yakuza office for chrissake!

26:20.260 --> 26:22.010
I don't give a fuck!

26:23.050 --> 26:24.840
Are you insane?

26:24.840 --> 26:27.720
Come on, Mitsuhashi! Sack up and fight me!

26:27.720 --> 26:29.470
Cool it! Just hold on, Nakano!

26:29.470 --> 26:30.600
Shut up!

26:30.600 --> 26:34.520
You've been blowing me off this long and I've had it!

26:36.730 --> 26:40.190
Hey, why did you come here again?

26:44.410 --> 26:47.120
Move your asses! They're up there!

26:53.870 --> 26:56.920
Fuck yeah! Now that's the shit I'm talking about.

26:56.920 --> 26:58.840
I'm about to overflow with adrenaline!

26:58.840 --> 27:01.220
Christ, you're seriously tripping.

27:01.220 --> 27:03.460
You keep this up and nobody'll wanna be friends!

27:03.460 --> 27:05.920
I don't give a shit!

27:05.920 --> 27:06.600
You little—

27:06.600 --> 27:07.840
Now's my turn!

27:07.840 --> 27:09.800
I'll take any one of you on!

27:10.810 --> 27:12.940
What are you, a fucking kickboxer?

27:12.940 --> 27:14.770
Lights out for you!

27:14.770 --> 27:16.890
Eat dick!

27:21.150 --> 27:23.570
So they're fighting each other, are they?

27:24.240 --> 27:26.200
Boys! No kid gloves this time!

27:26.200 --> 27:28.120
Beat the fear of the yakuza into them!

27:28.120 --> 27:28.820
Yes, boss!

27:28.820 --> 27:29.780
Let's go!

27:30.160 --> 27:32.120
You little punks!

27:33.790 --> 27:34.910
Fucking...

27:35.580 --> 27:36.500
Dammit!

27:37.540 --> 27:39.170
Will you settle down?!

27:40.210 --> 27:41.710
For the love of...

27:41.710 --> 27:44.300
Hey! You know how deep the shit is you're in?

27:47.220 --> 27:49.890
The lousy fucks are ignoring us!

27:49.890 --> 27:50.640
Get ‘em!

27:52.890 --> 27:54.190
Shut up!

27:54.190 --> 27:56.310
We're busy here!

27:56.090 --> 27:56.130
Love

27:56.090 --> 27:56.130
Honor

28:07.940 --> 28:11.200
Fuck! Why does <i>everybody gotta get in my way?!</i>

28:12.240 --> 28:14.950
Do you know who the fuck you're talking to?

28:16.290 --> 28:17.080
You ain't...

28:17.830 --> 28:20.040
leaving this fucking place alive!

28:22.340 --> 28:25.220
Now, shall we continue, bottle blond?

28:25.220 --> 28:26.640
H-Hey!

28:32.470 --> 28:35.430
Those bitches! They're not getting away!

28:39.810 --> 28:41.600
Shoot! Don't forget Imai!

28:41.600 --> 28:45.070
Wait! Don't leave me!

28:49.370 --> 28:50.740
This ain't no time to laugh!

28:53.620 --> 28:54.990
Don't leave me!

29:02.090 --> 29:02.920
I'm pooped!

29:03.340 --> 29:06.760
That midget... will get us killed!

29:06.760 --> 29:09.220
You're the one who decided to bring him!

29:09.220 --> 29:10.880
Yo.

29:16.350 --> 29:18.850
Now why did you sneak off without my permission?

29:18.850 --> 29:20.700
That's harsh.

29:23.770 --> 29:25.570
Scared, are we?

29:25.570 --> 29:27.980
Are you that afraid of little ol' me?

29:28.320 --> 29:30.570
Who are you calling scared?

29:33.530 --> 29:36.490
Fine, we'll mix it up until you're good.

29:36.790 --> 29:38.790
That's what I wanna hear.

29:38.790 --> 29:41.660
Now I can finally pay you back for Kyoto!

29:42.160 --> 29:43.880
Bring it on, chump.

29:43.880 --> 29:48.750
The next time you wake up, you'll be in a box addressed to Ibaraki!

30:06.610 --> 30:08.030
How's that, you hick?

30:08.030 --> 30:10.690
You ain't no match for me no matter how hard you try!

30:10.690 --> 30:13.110
Shove it up your ass! We ain't through yet!

30:14.530 --> 30:16.910
The kid's got guts.

30:16.910 --> 30:19.620
H-Hey, Itou!

30:18.250 --> 30:19.620
Bastard!

30:19.620 --> 30:22.910
How could you leave behind the guy you came to rescue?

30:23.830 --> 30:25.380
Sorry about that.

30:25.380 --> 30:28.460
Nakano threw a monkey wrench in our plans.

30:29.090 --> 30:32.090
Anyway, can't you do something about that posture of yours?

30:33.640 --> 30:34.760
What is it, Itou?

30:35.180 --> 30:39.720
Imai, it looks like you brought along some unwanted guests.

30:41.190 --> 30:42.180
Imai, look out!

30:42.900 --> 30:43.690
What the...?

30:43.690 --> 30:45.350
Watch out, we've been followed!

30:53.780 --> 30:58.280
You schoolboys have been up to some mischief while I was gone.

30:59.290 --> 31:01.460
It's the boss who had that granny bike!

31:01.460 --> 31:03.750
So the big cheese finally shows himself?

31:03.750 --> 31:08.710
I'm gonna make sure you knows the goddamn difference...

31:08.710 --> 31:11.170
between the yakuza and punk hoodlums!

31:11.170 --> 31:12.300
Th-There it is!

31:12.300 --> 31:13.630
I-It's a gun!

31:15.720 --> 31:18.180
Quit spoiling our fun, else I'll kill you!

31:22.230 --> 31:22.730
It...

31:22.730 --> 31:23.560
It's...

31:23.560 --> 31:26.020
It's real!

31:26.400 --> 31:27.980
Skinny little punkasses.

31:27.980 --> 31:30.780
Go get ‘em! Don't let one of 'em escape!

31:30.780 --> 31:31.440
Got it!

31:31.440 --> 31:32.980
Dammit! Jump in!

31:38.360 --> 31:40.120
You little shitstains!

31:40.120 --> 31:42.330
You thinks you can get away!

31:45.120 --> 31:47.040
How long you think they can hold their breaths?

31:56.510 --> 31:58.050
S-Seaweed!

31:58.550 --> 32:00.100
Dumbfuck!

32:10.980 --> 32:13.030
They aren't coming up at all.

32:14.030 --> 32:17.820
We really can't have the deaths of high school kids on our hands.

32:17.820 --> 32:18.820
Especially four of them.

32:29.660 --> 32:31.380
Dumbass! Don't let go of the rock!

32:31.380 --> 32:32.130
You'll get shot!

32:32.800 --> 32:35.300
No! I don't wanna die!

32:39.510 --> 32:42.680
Crap! That guy's definitely a goner!

32:44.430 --> 32:46.060
S-Sudou...

32:46.060 --> 32:48.400
Nobody say a word about what happened here.

32:48.400 --> 32:50.810
I never messed with no high schoolers.

32:50.810 --> 32:53.560
I don't knows no Imai or no blond kid, got it?

32:53.940 --> 32:55.240
Back to our establishment!

32:55.240 --> 32:56.150
Right!

33:02.580 --> 33:04.540
Ah, thank God!

33:04.540 --> 33:07.790
Imai can come in handy sometimes.

33:07.790 --> 33:09.580
Hey!

33:09.580 --> 33:12.630
Help me! I don't wanna die!

33:12.630 --> 33:15.260
Why does he always gotta be like that?

33:12.630 --> 33:15.800
Help me! Help!

33:15.260 --> 33:17.590
I pity him.

33:15.800 --> 33:17.590
Save me!

33:17.590 --> 33:20.640
Hey! Somebody help!

33:20.640 --> 33:22.720
Now my shoes are all wet.

33:22.720 --> 33:24.640
Yo, bottle blond and spikes.

33:24.640 --> 33:26.810
We'll call a truce for now. But I'll be back for you.

33:26.810 --> 33:27.850
I'm out.

33:27.850 --> 33:29.440
Don't ever come back, you chimp!

33:29.440 --> 33:31.020
Get your ass back to Ibaraki!

33:31.020 --> 33:32.690
Help me!

33:32.690 --> 33:36.280
Hurry up and save me, you sons of bitches!

33:36.280 --> 33:37.440
Itou.

33:36.490 --> 33:37.700
Help!

33:37.440 --> 33:38.200
Yeah?

33:37.700 --> 33:39.610
Somebody help me!

33:38.200 --> 33:41.370
Don't the fireworks look pretty from the river?

33:39.610 --> 33:41.410
Help me, please!

33:41.370 --> 33:43.830
Yeah, I agree.

33:41.410 --> 33:45.160
Hey! Someone help!

33:47.400 --> 33:47.440
Benibane Senior High School

33:47.620 --> 33:50.580
Really? That's our Imai!

33:50.580 --> 33:53.290
So then you had your back to the gun?

33:53.290 --> 33:57.260
Yeah, I thought fast and risked everything on that gamble.

33:57.260 --> 34:03.090
My playing dead saved the lives of Mitsuhashi, Itou, and that one weird dude.

34:03.090 --> 34:05.930
It's not like I wanted to save their lives or nothing,

34:05.930 --> 34:07.270
but I <i>was the cause of it all.</i>

34:07.270 --> 34:09.640
So I gotta be the responsible party.

34:09.640 --> 34:12.180
You're hardcore, Imai!

34:12.690 --> 34:14.400
Yo.

34:15.520 --> 34:18.650
That transfer student's got a serious attitude problem.

34:18.650 --> 34:20.860
Imai, you need to show him who's boss.

34:20.860 --> 34:22.780
T-Transfer student?

34:22.780 --> 34:24.200
I-I'm getting dizzy...

34:25.660 --> 34:27.490
I-Imai! What's wrong?!

34:27.490 --> 34:29.080
Get a hold of yourself, boss!

34:29.080 --> 34:31.080
Imai!

34:40.710 --> 34:42.820
Let's worry about the future tomorrow.

34:42.820 --> 34:45.560
When tomorrow comes, it'll all work out.

34:48.820 --> 34:50.860
If it doesn't work out, I'll just run away.

34:50.860 --> 34:53.640
If I'm found, I'll make up an excuse.

34:56.820 --> 34:58.840
You and me are friends, partner.

34:58.840 --> 35:00.820
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

35:04.780 --> 35:06.860
I help you.

35:05.700 --> 35:06.860
We're family.

35:06.860 --> 35:08.790
I like you.

35:20.810 --> 35:22.780
On stressful days, I'll hit you.

35:22.780 --> 35:25.470
Then, I'll say, "I'm sorry," and you'll forgive me.

35:28.690 --> 35:30.230
That cute girl is mine,

35:30.230 --> 35:33.140
but I belong to no one.

35:36.760 --> 35:38.780
We're all brothers and sisters in this world.

35:38.780 --> 35:40.650
When the going gets tough, the tough kick and scream.
